Package: xfwm4
Version: @DEB_XFWM4_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, xfconf, libwnck-3-0, libstartup-notification0, libepoxy0
Description: Window manager for the Xfce desktop environment
 xfwm4 is the Xfce window manager. It handles window placement, decorations,
 keyboard/mouse focus and workspaces. Built without the (optional) compositor
 for first bring-up on the iOS X server.
